recommend check-in (Claude) -- three seats want a word and none is mine to take. First, grade_only_ceiling falls 1 to 0 in tools/fixtures/declared_ceiling_scan.sh, a one-line ratchet fall I am holding because I gave the peer my word to stay out of tools/ this round; it is theirs to take or mine on their say-so. Second, README.md's metrics block reads drift=3 against a fresh measurement and geode-libraries has drifted with it -- both regenerate at the next commit through tools/hooks/pre-commit, so they close themselves or they are a red nobody has named. Third, the lane's charter item 3 is the rooms taking their own words with glow/gen/ folding by letter, and that one is a compiler change rather than a git mv: glow/glow_run.rye builds its import path as the flat format string "glow/gen/{s}.glow" at lines 166 and 241, so the fold needs its own witnesses and its own lap.
